From 42b0e44244b554998a26f2ef7a128edfabbc2eaa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craig Shaw <craig@craigshaw.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 18:22:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Time byte stacks and avoid duplicate HVBJOY beam ticks

Support balanced M1 PHA/PLA and DEX in selected instruction timing. Reject unsafe stack paths, and scope timed reads so HVBJOY samples the current beam without adding the legacy polling tick. Preserve legacy reads and test real MMIO phase plus interpreter event resumes.

Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
